{
  "file": "---\nstatus: active\nentity: widgets\nowner: owner\n---\n\n# Widgets\n<!-- stay:gHN81kMw hash=sha256:7a47bebe8068 -->\n\n> State for the widget rollout. The design lives elsewhere; this file keeps\n> the queue and the log.\n\n## Action\n<!-- stay:3PznC2DN hash=sha256:2261b4c779c1 -->\n\n- [x] **Ship the widget.** Compatible. <!-- stay:uXsvBQT0 subhash=sha256:145a6f9daa98 -->\n\n- [x] `agent` **Refresh the fixtures. (2026-09-03)** Regenerate from the\n      seeded corpus.\n      **Gate**: the fixture diff is empty. <!-- stay:FwvpUpW2 subhash=sha256:62b32f7bca5a -->\n\n- [ ] **Added** <!-- stay:4g1I6FqL subhash=sha256:22c6b1fa9ec2 -->\n<!-- stay:OczduVUV hash=sha256:ee7fd9b71f91 -->\n\n## Notes\n<!-- stay:Q6BsNG2s hash=sha256:63e13e87b378 -->\n\nBackground a session needs, not a queue. Nothing addresses these items, so a\ndefault stamp leaves them alone; `select: {\"kind\": \"document\"}` stamps them.\n\n- The rollout is gated on the migration note, not on the build. <!-- stay:a0XLZ6qp subhash=sha256:d832e71118d0 -->\n- `widget-cli release --to <channel>` is the only supported publish path. <!-- stay:siJkuh3c subhash=sha256:013cd4be0df7 -->\n<!-- stay:UejmzUmL hash=sha256:ed582f65d943 -->\n\n## Log\n<!-- stay:SYTQgDo0 hash=sha256:9c2666c69e87 -->\n\nNewest first, one entry per event.\n\n### 2026-09-05: compatible\n<!-- stay:LT823JEU hash=sha256:4618ee5a78de -->\n\nChecked.\n\n### 2026-09-03: fixtures drifted\n<!-- stay:dExp2TVH hash=sha256:d55499825d7d -->\n\nThe seeded corpus changed shape; the fixtures need regenerating.\n\n### 2026-08-28: pilot confirmed\n<!-- stay:vt8d8QRp hash=sha256:d59c4e292d93 -->\n\nSam confirmed the pilot customer.\n",
